          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-7a617b9e44@example.invalid",
          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Wed Sep 11 2024 17:54:33 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Transfer patients with an air transfer system</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This system uses a cushion of air to help laterally transfer your patients with significantly less exertion and without the need for lifting. It’s designed to simultaneously inflate and cradle your patients to keep them comfortable and properly positioned. The system can remain with your patients and provide transfer assistance throughout their hospital stay, whether in the ER, OR, Cath Lab or patient care rooms.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Integrated head support inflates to provide comfort and support for the head and neck</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Quick connect valve provides an easy, secure connection and a quick release</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Hose Protection Sleeve helps protect hose from environmental contamination</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">M² Microclimate Body Pad effectively absorbs and locks in moisture to protect patient’s skin while allowing air to flow through</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Imaging capability is acceptable for use in MRI,* X-Ray, CT Scan and ultrasounds<sup>1</sup></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 24 2024 17:28:51 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true",
          "bottomMargin": "3"
        },
        "sectionseparator": {
          "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
