          "jcr:created": "Wed Sep 11 2024 18:03:11 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #1c5687;\">48%</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">of caregiver injuries that result in days away from work are caused by overexertion or bodily reaction often related to patient handling<sup>4</sup></span></p>\n",
